<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Fighter Skills</h1>
<p>The skills the Fighters' guild of Midgaard teaches. Level is the guild level at which you can first practice the skill there, and Up to is the most you can learn it at the guild (see <a cmd='#'>Help Practice</a>). Some skills also need strength, dexterity or charisma before you can practise them.
</p>
<pre>Name                 Level   Up to   Practising needs
Armor Soft Leather       0   100%
Bash                     0   100%    strength 10
Climb                    0   80%
Consider                 0   80%
Diagnostics              0   80%
Evaluating               0   70%
Fleeing                  0   70%
Search                   0   70%
Shield                   0   100%    strength 10
Swimming                 0   80%
Two Weapon Style         0   70%     dexterity 30
Rescue                   1   70%
Armor Hard Leather       7   100%    strength 15
Disarming               10   100%    dexterity 10
Armor Chain             15   100%    strength 30
Leadership              15   50%     charisma 20
Armor Plate             20   80%     strength 50
</pre>
